  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"代理商-投放报表\"],\"business_line\":[\"代理商\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取代理商竞价投放数据，对应方舟平台「投放-数据概览-汇总数据-竞价数据」，可通过筛选条件查询指定时间和客户范围的数据。配合接口有【获取Access token】和【获取行业列表】。\",\"id\":\"agent.adv_bidding.list_query\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/agent/adv/bidding/list/query/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1815032517161050\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access_token.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"industry_list.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"本接口的筛选条件中一级和二级行业名称可从该接口获取\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取行业列表\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1815032517161050\",\"title\":\"代理商竞价投放数据 \"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5URkaRhg\">代理商竞价投放数据，对应方舟平台「投放-数据概览-汇总数据-竞价数据」</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201814775041927172%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-r7o1jnt3\" id=\"h346b9f0-r7o1jnt3\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-SEqJIQQW\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/agent/adv/bidding/list/query/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/agent/adv/bidding/list/query/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1815032517161050\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-KeUAD8FE\" id=\"h346b9f0-KeUAD8FE\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-O62k4DWo\">Get</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-VE5Z2vb1\" id=\"h346b9f0-VE5Z2vb1\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ooVabtJe\" id=\"h346b9f0-ooVabtJe\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">agent_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DoY9tx3V\">代理商账户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-41tqOTLv\">开始时间。格式：YYYY-MM-DD。闭区间,可选日期范围是今天及以前（允许包括今天）。\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-S8Ta1Lk1\">结束时间。格式：YYYY-MM-DD。闭区间,可选日期范围是今天及以前（允许包括今天）。开始时间与结束时间的跨度不能超过90天。\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">筛选条件。</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FRqeE4Xg\">客户 id 列表，若选填该字段，则最少应上传1个客户id，最多支持同时查询100个客户。</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">company_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">客户所属公司名称，若选填该字段，限制最小长度为1，最大长度为223。支持模糊查询。</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">active</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">用户活跃状态。可选枚举值: ACTIVE表示活跃用户,ALL表示所有用户。不填写该字段则默认值为ALL。 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Y1TJX82L\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2M2Ph8UR\"><code>ALL</code> 全部账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-K6cHlZBl\"><code>ACTIVE</code> 活跃账户</li></ul> 默认值: <code>ALL</code></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">first_industry</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">一级行业名称。可从【获取行业列表】接口获取。</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">second_industry</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">二级行业名称。可从【获取行业列表】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户状态。详见【附录-账户状态】，可选枚举值: STATUS_CONFIRM_FAIL,STATUS_CONFIRM_FAIL_END,STATUS_CONFIRM_MODIFY_FAIL,STATUS_DISABLE,STATUS_ENABLE,STATUS_ENABLE_AND_AVATAR_AUDITING,STATUS_PENDING_CONFIRM,STATUS_PENDING_CONFIRM_MODIFY,STATUS_PENDING_VERIFIED,STATUS_PUNISH,STATUS_SELF_SERVICE_UNAUDITED,STATUS_WAIT_FOR_ACCOUNT_FEE,STATUS_WAIT_FOR_BPM_AUDIT,STATUS_WAIT_FOR_BPM_FILE_CONTACT,STATUS_WAIT_FOR_PUBLIC_AUTH。 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-j17JMjbi\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-e8LY35hX\"><code>STATUS_DISABLE</code> 已禁用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-E2pWIRlI\"><code>STATUS_PENDING_CONFIRM</code> 审核中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ETEOjc55\"><code>STATUS_PENDING_VERIFIED</code> 待验证</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gBDAoWcE\"><code>STATUS_CONFIRM_FAIL</code> 审核失败/可再次申请</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eX16EM6N\"><code>STATUS_ENABLE</code> 已审核</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-87W1ns1A\"><code>STATUS_CONFIRM_FAIL_END</code> 审核失败/最终状态</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jlp0KJpX\"><code>STATUS_PENDING_CONFIRM_MODIFY</code> 修改审核中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-EbPsZm2Y\"><code>STATUS_CONFIRM_MODIFY_FAIL</code> 修改审核失败</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LVr0CPg2\"><code>STATUS_PUNISH</code> 惩罚</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1UvkcLN8\"><code>STATUS_WAIT_FOR_BPM_AUDIT</code> 等待CRM审核</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QaAwrtxo\"><code>STATUS_SELF_SERVICE_UNAUDITED</code> 等待验证资质</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TRQYaIXe\"><code>STATUS_ENABLE_AND_AVATAR_AUDITING</code> 已审核,头像审核中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BxUcAlzI\"><code>STATUS_WAIT_FOR_BPM_FILE_CONTACT</code> SMB客户待合同生效</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Yyv3enle\"><code>STATUS_WAIT_FOR_ACCOUNT_FEE</code> SMB客户待缴纳开户费</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TxJd3d8o\"><code>STATUS_WAIT_FOR_PUBLIC_AUTH</code> 待对公验证</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cursor</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RIheZBAq\">游标。第一次查询不填或传0。后续查询使用出参的cursor字段</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cursor_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">页面大小，即一页展示的数据数量。取值范围: 1-1000。</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-pwB4SP9F\" id=\"h346b9f0-pwB4SP9F\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Fagent%2Fadv%2Fbidding%2Flist%2Fquery%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20post(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20